  "bookId": "1SA",
  "reference": "1 Sang'Weli 24",
  "copyright": "PUBLIC DOMAIN",
  "verseCount": 22,
  "content": [
    {
      "name": "chapter",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "number": "24",
        "style": "c",
        "sid": "1SA 24"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "24",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Daūdi kūleka kūmūlaga Saulo",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 24:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū Saulo aho wafuma kūbapeeja a Bafilisiti ūwīlwa, “Ū Daūdi alī kwitogolo lya Engedi.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.24.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.24.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 24:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Na lūūlū ū Saulo ūsola ibità lya banhū shihūmbī shidatū, abo baalī basanyiwe hose pye ū mu sī ya Isilaeli; ūbūūka alolile kū mawe ga ngūlūgūlū, kūja akūnkoobaga ū Daūdi na a banhū bakwe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.24.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.24.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 24:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aho ajile ūshika h'ipandī ilebe jalīho mbīgīlī ja ng'holo; bbihī henaho lyalīho ipilinga, ū Saulo ūbīta hoi, wingīla mo kwifuula. Gashi nang'hwe ū Daūdi na a banhū bakwe baalī ū ng'wipilinga lyenīlo, ū kū būtongi walyo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.24.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.24.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 24:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "A banhū ba ng'wa Daūdi būng'wīla, “Ū lwenūlū angū hū ū lūshikū ūlo SEEBA akalūhaya aho wakūwīlaga gīkī, ‘Ū ng'wanishi wako nakūntūūla mu makono gako ūng'wītīle gīt'ūmo ūtogelilwe.’” Ū Daūdi wegeela hoi akūkūngīlaga, ūshika wībbuta ī ng'hanjo ya ng'wa Saulo ha neno; alīyo atabonilwe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.24.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.24.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 24:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Gwike a hanuma ya henaho, ī ng'holò yakwe ū Daūdi yandya kūnkoya no, nguno ya kūbbuta ī shizwalo sha ng'wa Saulo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.24.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.24.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 24:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "A banhū bakwe ūbawīla, “Ū SEEBA anihame ū nene ū kūng'wītīla ntaale wane mhayo gūlī gīko, ū ng'witīīlwa maguta o ng'wa SEEBA. Ū nene yaya ū kūmūūkīja nkono gwane, nguno ū wei alī ng'witīīlwa maguta o ng'wa SEEBA.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.24.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.24.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 24:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū mu mihayo yenīyo ū Daūdi ūbiza wabahama a banhū bakwe, atabazunīlīgije ū kūndumīla ū Saulo. Hanuma ya henaho ū Saulo ūpuluka ū ng'wipilinga ūbūūka ajile. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.24.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.24.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 24:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nū Daūdi ūpuluka ū ng'wipilinga lyenīlo; hūna ūng'hīlīka ū Saulo alīhaya, “Baba ntemi!” Ū Saulo aho wikībūka kūlola ū kū numa, ū Daūdi winama kūshisha ū būshū wakwe būkuumya hasī. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.24.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.24.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 24:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ūng'wīla ū Saulo, “Nibūlī ūkūbadegelekaga a banhū ūlū baakūwīla gīkī, ‘Ū Daūdi alī na ng'hūmbū ja kūkūbūlaga?’ ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.24.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.24.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 24:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ī lelo lūūlū lolaga na miso gako, ūbone gīkī aho ūlī ū ng'wipilinga ū SEEBA walī wakūtūūlaga mu makono gane. A banhū baalī banigaagaanīlaga gīkī nakūbūlage, alīyo nūkūleka; nūhaya gīkī, ‘Natūdūla kūmūūkīja nkono gwane ū ntaale wane, nguno alī ng'witīīlwa maguta o ng'wa SEEBA.’ ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.24.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.24.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 24:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ali lolaga aha baba, līīl'ibbudīka lya ng'hanjo yako mu nkono gwane! Naalī nītīna ī ng'hanjo yako kamesulwa, alīyo ū bebe nūūkūleka ū kūkūbūlaga. Na lūūlū ī haha managa hape, hama witegeleje gīkī ū nene natī na būbi ū kūlī bebe, nūūlū natakūgomelile. Ū nene nataalī kūkūhūba mhayo gose gose, alīyo ū bebe ūkūnikoobaga kūhaya kūnīngīja būpanga nū mhayo ndūhū. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.24.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.24.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 24:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū SEEBA leka alamule wei ng'wenekīlī a ha gatī yise ū bebe nū nene. Nīyo ū SEEBA hū ng'wene ūyo akūkūlīpīla ī shiilī kūlwa būbi bose ūbo ūkūnītīlaga, alīyo ūlū ū nene yaya gete ū kūkūkuumya na nkono gwane. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.24.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.24.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 24:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Lūlīho lūsumo lwa bana kale lūhayīlile gīkī, ‘Ī shītwa ī shabūbi shikilongaga kūfuma mu bakenaagūji.’ Na lūūlū ū nkono gwane gūtī gwa kūkūkuumya ū bebe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.24.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.24.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 24:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ī gīsī ū ntemi wa Isilaeli wafumile kūnkūūbīja nani? Ūkūkūūbījaga kī? Ītī mvwa īchiile dūhū, nūūlū ka būda? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.24.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.24.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 24:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū SEEBA ni abizage namuji a ha gatī yise, wei ng'wenekīlī atūlekanye. Akabone a kashimīzīle kaane anilang'hane, nī ng'hana yane ayooleche mu nzīla ya kūnipīja ū mu nkono gwako.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.24.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.24.15"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Saulo kūbūbona būhūbi bokwe",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 24:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.24.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.24.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 24:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū Daūdi aho wamala kūyomba ī mihayo yenīyo, ū Saulo ūbūūja, “Ī lyenīlo ilaka lyako ng'wana wane Daūdi?” Ūlīla n'ilaka lya higūlya. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.24.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.24.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 24:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ūhaya, “Ū bebe ūlī ntūngīlīja kūtinda ū nene; īyo wanītīlaga ī lelo yawiza no, nūūlū īkī ū nene nakūkwītīlaga yabūbi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.24.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.24.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 24:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ī haha yenīyī waniwīla ū mhayo gwawiza ūyo wanītīlaga; gīkī ū SEEBA walī wanitūūlaga mu makono gako, alīyo ū bebe ūleka ū kūnibūlaga. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.24.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.24.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 24:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ī gīsī ng'hana ūlū munhū ūmpandīka ng'wanishi wakwe, akūneka gīko dūhū nūūlū kūng'wītīla mhayo yaya? Ū SEEBA akūnoong'he inong'ho lyawiza kūlwa wiza ūbo wanītīlaga lelo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.24.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.24.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 24:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nadeebile hape gīkī ūkūbiza ntemi wa Isilaeli, nī gīkī ū būtemi wa Baisilaeli būkūpandīka nguzu ū mu makono gako. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.24.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.24.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 24:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ali lūlū, ī haha nilahīlīlage kūlī SEEBA gīkī ūtūbūyagaja ū būbyīle wane, nī lina lyane ūtūlīfuta lījimīīle ū mu kaya ya ng'wa baba.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.24.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.24.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 24:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū Daūdi ūng'wilahīlīla ū Saulo ū mhayo gwenūyo. Hūna ū Saulo ūshoka kaya; alīyo ū Daūdi na a banhū bakwe būshoka mo hangī ū ng'wipilinga ī lya kwibisīla.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.24.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.24.22"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
